  "description": "Byeoridoryeong is a netherworld shaman who has made a name for himself by picking off those who delay their deaths. One day, as he goes about his business, he receives news of the theft of the Jewel of Beauty, which he keeps in the Heavenly Palace. Can he find it and restore his honour as a prince?\n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)",
